# Vendored system-tray

This crate is patched on purpose:

- Soft-fail malformed `IconPixmap` / tooltip properties
- Do not drop the whole item or abort the host on one bad client
- Keep the registration stream alive

Do not revert those behaviors. Do not enable `dbusmenu-gtk3`. Skyline renders menus in iced. Prefer fixing parsing/robustness here over workarounds in `skyline-services/src/tray.rs`.
